id: JUDGE4-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: command_class
target: crates/core/src/command_class.rs
find: return Ok(CommandClass::Unknown);
replace: return Ok(CommandClass::WrongOrder);
expect-fail: wrong_input_pairs_are_classified_100_percent
expect-fail: unknown_name_is_unknown_for_any_step_and_status
note: 表に無い名前を未知のコマンドにしない（順序違いに倒す）
